G4016.def:
**περι-βάλλω **
[in LXX chiefly for כָּסָה pi., also for לָבַשׁ, עָטָה, etc. ;]
**to throw around or over, put on or over**;
(a) **of siege or defen­sive works**: χάρακά σοι, [[Luk.19.43|Luk.19:43]] (WH, mg.; παρεμβ-, WH, txt.);
(b) **of clothing, to put on, wrap about, clothe with**: with accusative of thing(s), [[Luk.23.11|Luk.23:11]] with accusative of person(s), [[Mat.25.36, 38; 25.43|Mat.25:36, 38 25:43]]; with dupl. accusative (not cl.; Bl., § 34, 4), [[Jhn.19.2|Jhn.19:2]] pf. pass., **to have wrapped round one**: with accusative of thing(s) (cl.), [[Mrk.14.51; 16.5|Mrk.14:51 16:5]], [[Rev.7.9, 13; 10.1; 11.3; 12.1; 17.4; 18.16; 19.13|Rev.7:9, 13 10:1 11:3 12:1 17:4 18:16 19:13]]; with dative of thing(s), [[Rev.4.4|Rev.4:4]] (WH, txt.; before ἐν, WH, mg.); fut., before ἐν (of. [[Deu.22.12|Deu.22:12]], [[Psa.45.9, 13|Psa.45:9, 13]]), [[Rev.3.5|Rev.3:5]]. Mid., **to clothe oneself, wrap round or put on oneself**: absol., [[Mat.6.29|Mat.6:29]], [[Luk.12.27|Luk.12:27]], [[Rev.3.18|Rev.3:18]]; with accusative of thing(s), [[Mat.6.31|Mat.6:31]], [[Act.12.8|Act.12:8]], [[Rev.19.8|Rev.19:8]].†
(AS)

G4009.def:
**πέρας**, -ατος, τό
(πέρα, beyond), [in LXX chiefly for קֵץ, קָצָה and cognate forms ;]
**an end, limit, boundary**;
(a) **of space**: chiefly in pl., τὰ π. τ. γῆς, [[Mat.12.42|Mat.12:42]], [[Luk.11.31|Luk.11:31]]; τ. οἰκουμένης, [[Rom.10.18|Rom.10:18]] (LXX);
(b) (opposite to ἀρχή) the end: with genitive, ἀντιλογίας, [[Heb.6.10|Heb.6:10]]†
(AS)

G4094.def:
**πίναξ**, -ακος, ὁ
[in LXX: [[4Ma.17.7|4Ma.17:7]] R * ;]
prop., a board, plank; hence, of various at wooden articles;
(a) **a tablet**;
(b) **a disc, a dish**: [[Mat.14.8, 11|Mat.14:8, 11]], [[Mrk.6.25, 28|Mrk.6:25, 28]] [[Luk.11.39|Luk.11:39]].†
(AS)

G4005.def:
**πεντηκοστός**, -ή, -όν
[in LXX for חֲמִישִׁי, חֲמִישִׁי, [[Lev.25.10-11|Lev.25:10-11]], [[2Ki.15.23; 15.27|4Ki.15:23 15:27]]; [[1Ma.4.1-61|1Ma.4:1-61]], [[2Ma.14.4|2Ma.14:4]]; ἡ π., [[Tob.2.1|Tob.2:1]], [[2Ma.12.32|2Ma.12:32]] * ;]
fiftieth. As subst., ἡ π.;
(a) (sc. μερίς), at Athens, a tax of two per cent.;
(b) (sc. ἡμέρα, i.e. the fiftieth day after the Passover), Pentecost, the second of the three great Jewish feasts (To, 2Mac, ll. with; ἑορτὴ ἑβδομάδων, [[Deu.16.10|Deu.16:10]], al.) : [[Act.2.1; 20.16|Act.2:1 20:16]], [[1Co.16.8|1Co.16:8]].†
(AS)

G4088.def:
**πικρία**, -ας, ἡ
(πικρός), [in LXX chiefly for מַר and cognate forms ;]
**bitterness**;
(a) of taste (Arist., [[Jer.15.17|Jer.15:17]], al.);
(b) metaphorically, of temper, character, etc.: [[Rom.3.14|Rom.3:14]] (LXX), [[Eph.4.31|Eph.4:31]] ῥίζα πικρίας, [[Heb.12.15|Heb.12:15]] χολὴ π., a malignant disposition, [[Act.8.23|Act.8:23]]†
(AS)
